@page "/mailing-lists-how-it-works"

<PageTitle>How Mailing Lists Work - EMA</PageTitle>

<div class="container my-4" style="max-width: 900px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
    <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <h2 class="fw-bold" style="color: #000;">How Mailing Lists Works</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold text-decoration-underline">Three lists are looked at in order to come up with the send list:</h5>
        <ol class="ps-3">
            <li class="mb-1"><strong>Donors selected because of their giving history</strong> (e.g. A donor who gave $1,000+ last year, but nothing this year).</li>
            <li class="mb-1"><strong>Donors who may not give but want to be included</strong> (e.g. Grandparents with kids on an international mission trip).</li>
            <li class="mb-1"><strong>Donors who don’t want to be on the list</strong> (e.g. they are a business who wants to give to the school, but not interested in receiving a newsletter).</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold text-decoration-underline">The programming selects donors based on several steps:</h5>
        <ol type="a" class="ps-3">
            <li class="mb-1">Cleans up the Opt-in list by removing those the Opt-Ins that are on the Opt-Out list.</li>
            <li class="mb-1">Running the selection criteria against historical giving</li>
            <li class="mb-1">Adding the Opt-In Donors</li>
            <li class="mb-1">Removing the Opt-Out Donors</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold text-decoration-underline">Lastly, the list is tweaked based on how it is to be send out:</h5>
        <ul class="ps-3">
            <li class="mb-1">If it is going out by postal mail, it must have a proper mailing address</li>
            <li class="mb-1">If it is going out by email, it must have an email address</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold text-decoration-underline">You can then spot check the send list to make sure it looks right:</h5>
        <ol type="a" class="ps-3">
            <li class="mb-1">Make sure that a generous donor made the send list.</li>
            <li class="mb-1">Make sure that the grandparent who called is on the mailing list.</li>
            <li class="mb-1">Make sure that the business that opted out is not on the list.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="card shadow-sm border-secondary my-4">
        <div class="card-header bg-secondary text-white fw-bold text-center fs-5">
            How Donors Make the Send List
        </div>
        <div class="table-responsive">
